---
description: Operational finance integrity
alwaysApply: true
---

Use decimal-safe, reconstructable, append-only financial facts and reversible
corrections. Never infer money movement from browser success. Keep Stripe/provider state,
PerchPoint operational accounting, and formal accounting authority separate. Require
attributable authorization and idempotency for future money effects.
Requirements: `PP-FIN-001`, `PP-FIN-002`, `PP-FIN-003`, `PP-FIN-004`, `PP-FIN-005`, `PP-FIN-006`.
